{
  "name": "parse-formats",
  "description": "Parse four log formats into level (upper case: ERROR, WARN, INFO, DEBUG), service, message, and ts where the line carries a timestamp (ISO string for JSON lines). Formats: house 'LEVEL service: message'; JSON lines with ts/level/service/msg; RFC 3164 syslog '<pri>Mon dd hh:mm:ss host service[pid]: message' where level comes from pri & 7 (3=ERROR, 4=WARN, 6=INFO, 7=DEBUG); nginx access lines where service is 'nginx', message is 'METHOD path status', and level is ERROR for status >= 500, WARN for >= 400, else INFO. Anything unparseable is level UNKNOWN, service unknown.",
  "nodeId": "parse",
  "target": 0.95,
  "scorer": "fields",
  "examples": [
    {
      "input": {
        "id": "j0",
        "line": "{\"ts\": \"2026-09-23T14:00:11Z\", \"level\": \"debug\", \"service\": \"worker-1\", \"msg\": \"index rebuild took 14s\"}"
      },
      "expected": {
        "level": "DEBUG",
        "service": "worker-1",
        "message": "index rebuild took 14s",
        "ts": "2026-09-23T14:00:11Z"
      }
    },
    {
      "input": {
        "id": "j1",
        "line": "{\"ts\": \"2026-09-23T14:01:11Z\", \"level\": \"debug\", \"service\": \"worker-1\", \"msg\": \"job 8812 retried\"}"
      },
      "expected": {
        "level": "DEBUG",
        "service": "worker-1",
        "message": "job 8812 retried",
        "ts": "2026-09-23T14:01:11Z"
      }
    },
    {
      "input": {
        "id": "j2",
        "line": "{\"ts\": \"2026-09-23T14:02:11Z\", \"level\": \"warn\", \"service\": \"api\", \"msg\": \"job 8812 retried\"}"
      },
      "expected": {
        "level": "WARN",
        "service": "api",
        "message": "job 8812 retried",
        "ts": "2026-09-23T14:02:11Z"
      }
    },
    {
